{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5992ce70bebcb9afc802a438bda87a87aceda530331819d3a4d1999ce81560d7",
      "text": "—My fandom activities are about to\nenter a new stage.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6ef79341a386964f4ad134f191cbf113a73788a42e754f1fb744e071a69e370e",
      "text": "I'd like to aim higher soon.\nWould you be willing to help me?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cca746a1e11b94ff7bb4588b2b04c97ebeeda25ac912c4bc8f4b41cacdfd68de",
      "text": "...Um. So you're going to start\nsome new kind of fan activity?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:21d211d03cfac6910cd6ec14da95fa99e28c3680d63e7981c9a358d362c0a9ca",
      "text": "Cowdy. Specifically, I'd like to make\nhandmade chocolate. Would you teach\nme?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f49054aa0d631eb0144d407528d47e446a544e01862588fe7682f9385b245c87",
      "text": "I see! In that case, gladly!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3fdfeaf619ab6c9e99fba5e87ade611ba181817d3c7e39bc66618f5f7afb995a",
      "text": "Do you know what kind of chocolate\nyou want to make?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:349e63f70d09d5f106838fcf00994528e5364e97b8821ad94c997d7613b463aa",
      "text": "Well... It's only a rough image,\nbut—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0d270cea9a4989798d273ae9a12bf863fa6fd0b34249c7e8e477b967aeecb758",
      "text": "I'd like to recreate the event hall\nknown as the holy land of idols,\nat one-tenth scale. Perfectly.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c4731b7010d1fff66d8c5b95e87aba4af4ea64f0863a1a844536d959188a9fbc",
      "text": "Oh. No. Impossible.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8ba0172f18717d59b0a0232d95157c4deb7c2753a9bfa1d792937d8085c724db",
      "text": "About a hundred sets of it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:30a1edfa71b162d0c5c50588bab34e76a1e46adf48754cfe8e70aa228992777a",
      "text": "I said it's impossible!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "49": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7bca5aef2ef59204e3eda2d18239ee93e4a64a78fc1de2caa5856c13b89bfc66",
      "text": "Cowdy...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "53": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7c148e36509f3be38fc688b2663254c303bacc1012377b34f55933f7e393dbb8",
      "text": "I get how you feel, but a beginner\ncan't make chocolate that amazing,\nokay...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:16709cb4f74b07bcd1db89f99a6a6258a4a876286211212f7987ff48f33a64dd",
      "text": "And a hundred of them...?\nHmm...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "59": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:24773e10e7be2ac202a342ec018d2fd396db6411e3ed843951e3cb9382ac0d51",
      "text": "...Well... Normal chocolate... might\nbe doable...? Maybe???",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:811c9ddff749091e2e81f49e308c2ef35c8219d28efb52b74f98e14b95c22f31",
      "text": "Then please do that...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0451f4ad47dd301da9e25d55c6faf2bf610f29800a9d61573b6ef794f2791c28",
      "text": "B-but I think it'll be really hard\nwork...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1824c8598aaf3086929b599b89e3626532bb5ef30bbef42d54a1af255aa70470",
      "text": "Cowdy. Even so.\nI'm sorry to trouble you, Alk, but—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:26459751a48ca3318a511f9d4df1c394606743a1a76d070381b1d60ff2ed0ef7",
      "text": "—I want to give my love for idols\na shape.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:27cf5cf2656028f4633978fffc78f080d978298c5acbc68ee7cdf88a1dea1495",
      "text": "...Okay. Yeah! Let's do it!\nBeaucy!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cb916d6a0894ed3c1a9b5fdab057b3ecd6c6458375b54a43a7c3c570375d7fb6",
      "text": "—With this much, just gathering the\ningredients is a job in itself.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "90": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6fe9936331f38efd40274c5a0c417e7c68d6c87f170718325072b3a608293861",
      "text": "Cowdy. Sorry for the trouble.\nYou even came shopping with me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1553f3e3fb2ce0b4d878a782c541062ab9967570f9d76e2fd5c0c2619c80cc8e",
      "text": "No, I'm looking forward to making\nso much, too. And I need to buy\ndinner ingredients, too—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3ae563d401510c89e64ef36e736fa333ed63c370ef668eb12d0e60ea4630db61",
      "text": "Is something wrong?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "103": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0d92239ee549305f2a11b319d9bb14f837ddaf3d2683ca22d1be60ec4ece5de6",
      "text": "Oh. No... It's just the\nstares, kind of...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "106": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1eead8de620c0f9af8ea3ca8e360e54eaaf69506942c525c65afb385d865b500",
      "text": "Hey, isn't that Beaucy? She's got\na cow! Whoa, no way, it's the real\nthing!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:15774d28d53cc161b0c0da852b82edc3161635fe67e64b5be8361111dcab6abb",
      "text": "That figure... I'm so jealous...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dba909c867e3a5a3a1d6d49be2025b898c9ddb60ec3149d5b21e694370c9e671",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nYou get used to it. Things have\nbeen busy for you lately too, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fdedada5d339c5bd0c182511f7ddf8206f18bdcd5d947de128e58ff9e824bdf8",
      "text": "Yeah... People look at me more\nbecause of Shibuya. ...I'm still far\nfrom getting used to it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c53136d9b0209a711272812294dfc1d4de19accf12c25a6b732431ad66863b65",
      "text": "Um! You're Beaucy, right?!\nI'm a fan! Please sign this...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "121": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9261b27a63b060600673999000f5b5b71d5e29234e0926bd8ed0ffd9b4daf61d",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nThank you for always supporting me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "124": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e3a8dbbd5b7f0824af4ca48ebe17358d4691bb2184c718e144d4eb1e6820fc02",
      "text": "...Are you two on a secret date?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "127": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:196cc7d42c5b514ef5dab4f6ed8d05c4b51f9a1a86d60014f41a8f004d10033f",
      "text": "No, no! I'm the manager, so don't\nworry!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "131": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5c613faa89697fa5f9a44d9a5f4a7f4e357ca946ce35b21a7c9bb17be3c5af49",
      "text": "...Alk is not that kind of person.\nHe is a precious friend.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "134": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0dacbbabe5e3a5b21d73b09995e5f08b4926445b3e736d2885c62470fdbc9d74",
      "text": "R-right! Sorry for saying weird\nthings! Thanks for the autograph!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9f9cd7cdcc4516e2f77647dc488dd499d174e9a4e383eea862131f8b182108c7",
      "text": "Wow... I didn't expect people to\nsee us that way...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:94f11c8125b5ba173253fe235cee3112bde3885e0c571d0c24a71e4fb0b6c0a2",
      "text": "...Um. Beaucy?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "150": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0a342a9eb14def0c85f008c207605f337b72d5f99075781ad99969cc2090675d",
      "text": "Sorry, Alk. Actually, Beaucy is bad\nat talking about romance.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:040b493a537cf926ffd9a05fe5dfd3b177a568d850a75121523845285dcf8023",
      "text": "Cacow...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "161": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:038ae22fc37c50a0a5c2ade48e13a35c58fa9aae8c3014c7e37e3fa3055ecf70",
      "text": "No way...! You drop that on me\nnow? Isn't that way too cute?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "166": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0adb9147afd6a254257a50f31ab42f3de9c8ad86325e5eabcd0c6979496254be",
      "text": "D-don't be fooled. Romance is easy\nfor me. I always dream of lovely\nlove stories...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "171": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:92c9a3499d34188a23e6a183f6f5fd5d13e5bcd88d8f6c03b18abca4bd4ed6f6",
      "text": "Oh? Such as?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "175": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b1541c710827793e0249c74daa78fe78b254bc1c9aa6a468921ab3485c73692f",
      "text": "Such as?! ...W-well, let's see—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "182": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8a7991d05a96ac7f1b077d935b33c1df0812440449ad5054fa6dac85b97c6a48",
      "text": "Oh, Beaucy! No club today?\nWanna walk home together for the\nfirst time in ages?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f76b8e117121df081e4776274d2aef39051122986cdac6f78a6c5ce7788b1d70",
      "text": "Cowdy. We can't.\nWhat if someone sees us?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c506fa38c63ddd20f82bff78ad438711a6ecc7084f79ff39f6617ce9cf801756",
      "text": "Aw. We're childhood friends, so\nit's not weird.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "196": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d19cc1b6eea4f21dbbfed2bc26d29ce4666fe28b6ef3e5647a07f5f51b1032e3",
      "text": "Or... Should we tell everyone we\nare dating?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b391c832a45ddc27218f7077de8d6b31b328efdf06df181857b0a4bad4ec1767",
      "text": "It's total fantasy!!!!\nAnd it's a middle-school boy's!!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "208": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3be8b87819c9bd78fdcf3ff4fa82e744652b4d92f92d7b406915cac60fdb7fcf",
      "text": "Ugh, what is this...!\nThe secondhand embarrassment is\nbrutal...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "212": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e7623fc076bec8e4f8763aff34574494b74d51d9412c1827bdf0d8566cc5894b",
      "text": "Did you see that? This is how\nhopeless Beaucy is at romance...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "217": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0ce5971f6c37dc4bae38a55c750449a0f4a17e84b8b3af337443acae1d3a1019",
      "text": "B-Cowdy...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "222": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:31ee2c02f7ede858bad69e36230c8a49278ececc122c3ce5fc7e097f02b4b08b",
      "text": "W-well... I really understood how\nmuch you love idols...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "227": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:787e9e33f88c668804a15ccb935a49580fe187fc2262debdeeee500f23153c97",
      "text": "Please keep this to yourself!\nI beg you... I beg you...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "234": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1dfaa9a2db0f10b82b9c1e10752852beb2e06c021c9d6f3c0a61ea196ccac129",
      "text": "Lastly, a sprinkle of cocoa\npowder—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "238": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8388f6832be42258a309c81f939203220dffdfff46e47740e77bef2e720915bb",
      "text": "D-done...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "242": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:342a19e701f13db3166cd63c0c9927981250a2cf3e8d2dbf63aa13ad491f1446",
      "text": "Good work! Wow, we worked so hard!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "246": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f1874f741a88e17d4442dad6a27e555ac820b8407f8e82b4dfd93856f418909a",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nGood work to you too, Alk.\nThank you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "249": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d94c466b69ceb3fb97813fd5ce1f2dda8cc38ece47a777fa4e0c87a603262f1",
      "text": "—Heh.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "252": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dfd440014cc46b18f739d4ca934b658ccb67b063a0469621bd23d815602a572e",
      "text": "Now, shall we call everyone and\neat it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "256": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:443159f9709b51206471b2d75c0d6198b4b5e20ee189f55fd26fcc4dd49c737f",
      "text": "Huh?! Wait, aren't you going to\ngive it to idols?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "260": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a15dee15f622c0b80020f70ae132a697b2ec61c693f04c2733e99cf2d23bad96",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nI have no such intention.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "265": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0807b2f95131dbb5f686a3b474c744acb2f80aca62a22a5d1ecf44f5972cccdb",
      "text": "Most agencies ban gifts of food,\nespecially handmade.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "269": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:61db628d11c69778cdd89ffd9df9e66acf1197478fe104f02126f9db6094d73b",
      "text": "Ahh...? Oh, right. They do.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "274": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:04e2b9983daa54f92e0e6f32c1e307917ab36072620b3fa577b79b4eab5b4345",
      "text": "But giving my love a shape is what\nmatters. Right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "279": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2ddbcaa8ac71278f54700d4c82daa94b36225e19d49a6ee8ec939193d2668801",
      "text": "...Yeah.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "282": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:668821b88e280c22d42ae5e3082b35a0bb0e1809c84f692d80cc8b2ab813653a",
      "text": "In that case, let's all eat it\nwithout holding back!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "286": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5ec9745101ed23eddc5a03f80e04c50693480d29f87e509218740b46a4012701",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nBy all means.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
